// The labeled margin shared by the most kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns that margin.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mmode ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mmode rank

IMPULSE mmode 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mmode" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
